# Nudge → Production SaaS: Implementation Plan

## Current State Assessment

| Layer | Current | Target |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **Frontend** | 5 flat components, no folder structure, hardcoded `USER_ID` | Modular feature folders, context-based auth, reusable UI primitives |
| **Backend** | 6 flat Python files, SQLite, 6 API routes | Organized modules, new models for timeline/journal/profiles, 15+ routes |
| **Auth** | None — hardcoded `user_shinothomas_demo` | Google OAuth → JWT sessions → protected routes |
| **State** | `useState` per component, prop drilling | React Context for auth + portfolio, custom hooks for data fetching |
| **UX** | Functional but sparse — no empty states, no loading skeletons, no animations | Production-grade loading states, transitions, micro-interactions |

## Phased Roadmap

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a **large** transformation. I propose executing it in **4 phases**, each self-contained and testable. Each phase builds on the previous one. I recommend we go phase-by-phase with your approval at each gate.

