## Phase 3: Advanced Behavioral Features
**Goal:** Build the differentiating features that make Nudge unique.

### Behavioral Timeline
- Chronological feed of all sell attempts, nudges, outcomes
- Recovery tracking: "If you had held, your position would be worth ₹X"
- Market event annotations
- Visual timeline component with icons and connecting lines

### Investor Journal
- Pre-sell emotional check-in ("How are you feeling about this trade?")
- Post-trade reflection prompts
- Mood tagging system
- AI-generated weekly summaries of emotional patterns

### Recovery Outcome Tracking
- After each sell, track what the stock did in the following 7/30/90 days
- "What would have happened if you held" insight cards
- Aggregate missed gains/losses

### AI Behavioral Insights
- Weekly AI-generated behavioral summaries
- Pattern detection (e.g., "You tend to sell on Mondays after red markets")
- Personality profile computation

